OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Mint announces new 50p coins
OL,4,Ato celebrate Star Trek 60th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Mint has launched new
OL,7,Fcollectable 50p coins to celebrate 60
OL,8,Fyears of Star Trek on television
OL,9,Fscreens.
OL,11,FIt revealed two coin designs - one of
OL,12,Fthe iconic Vulcan hand salute alongside
OL,13,Fthe words "Live long and prosper", and
OL,14,Fthe other showing four of the show's
OL,15,Fflagship spacecrafts spanning different
OL,16,Feras of the franchise.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
