OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Mint announces new 50p coins
OL,4,Ato celebrate Star Trek 60th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo versions of each coin have been
OL,7,Fcreated - one in black and white and
OL,8,Fone in colour - which the coin makers
OL,9,Fsay was inspired by the advances in
OL,10,Fcolour television that were made in the
OL,11,F1960s.
OL,13,FTim Mulhall, the Royal Mint's head of
OL,14,Ffandom, said the coins "are designed
OL,15,Ffor fans who've grown up with the
OL,16,Ffranchise and want a piece of that
OL,17,Fhistory to treasure".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
